Package: shinyhub
Title: Publish Applications with the ShinyHub CLI
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Ruben J.", "Jongejan", email = "ruben.jongejan@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: RStudio addins for developing, checking, and publishing applications
    through the installed ShinyHub command-line interface. Credentials remain in
    the CLI credential store and deployment progress appears in the terminal.
